{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集超震撼！已被淘汰的吳俊峰（Mark）竟與陳若思（Amber）上演一幕車廂 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》最新一集超震撼！已被淘汰的吳俊峰（Mark）竟與陳若思（Amber）上演一幕車廂浪漫觀星約會，氣氛曖昧之際，Mark突然剖白內心，親揭一段痛苦的愛情陰影，更道出參加節目的真正原因，究竟他經歷過甚麼，令他講到眼濕濕？\n</p>\n<h2>Mark車廂觀星突變深情 浪漫約會剖白內心</h2>\n<p>在本周日（15日）播出的節目中，雖然Mark已被淘汰，但節目組依然保留了他與Amber的單對單「觀星車約會」。根據官方預告，Amber與Mark寫意地躺在車中觀星，Amber更大方露出「腳板仔」，率性又可愛。一直被指「零戀綜Feel」的Mark，在車上竟向Amber連環發放「愛的眼神」，望落既深情又深邃，場面超曖昧！Amber更坦言，第一輪收到三個心動吊墜時，曾懷疑Mark是第三個對她有意思的人，可惜因Mark「出動次數」太多而卻步，二人不禁感嘆總是緣慳一面，永遠只差「一點點」。</p>\n<h2>Mark首談愛情陰影「同Ex成日嗌交」</h2>\n<p>在浪漫氣氛下，Mark終於打開天窗說亮話，向Amber道出自己參賽以來，予人感覺只顧玩樂的背後真相，更首度剖白自己的「愛情陰影」。他感性地說：「其實我覺得自己唔係好適合拍拖，我希望下一次嗰個人係我結婚嘅對象」、「我真係好希望Meet到一個完全可以好舒服傾偈，唔會再嗌交嘅一個人」。他更沉重憶述與前度的關係：「我同我Ex成日嗌交，我哋嘗試去磨合，當我去遷就佢就我委屈，我委屈完我講，講完嗌交，之後到佢遷就我，到佢委屈。」一番話道出不少情侶的痛處。雖然緣盡節目，但Mark臨走前仍關心Amber的感情選擇，盡顯風度。\n</p>\n<h2>網民睇完預告勁心痛「原來係深情男」</h2>\n<p>預告片段一出，隨即引發網民熱烈討論，不少人對Mark的深情剖白大感意外，更表示對他完全改觀。網民紛紛留言力撐：「原來Mark唔係玩玩下，係有故事嘅男人！」、「聽到佢講同ex嗌交嗰度好有共鳴，遷就真係好辛苦」、「Amber走寶啦！咁深情嘅男仔去邊度搵？」、「睇到佢愛的眼神，真係好sad，明明差一點點…」、「支持Mark！希望佢現實中搵到個好女仔！」</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_6333724216af5644bcfe34.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_6333724216af5644bcfe34.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_16877732736af5645e1d601.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_16877732736af5645e1d601.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_4508398166af56461ec371.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_4508398166af56461ec371.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_17875271326af56465cdf12.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_17875271326af56465cdf12.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12723750366af5646db0630.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12723750366af5646db0630.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_1625383606af56477ba8ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/25_1625383606af56477ba8ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_392508486af5647b42666.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/26_392508486af5647b42666.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_9241003676af5647eeba24.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27_9241003676af5647eeba24.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_13011908786af564922a3fc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/32_13011908786af564922a3fc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_15101634196af564996f720.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/35_15101634196af564996f720.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_12248132026af5649d19425.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"女神配對計劃2 吳俊峰 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/36_12248132026af5649d19425.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%90%b3%e4%bf%8a%e5%b3%b0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">吳俊峰</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%b3%e7%a5%9e%e9%85%8d%e5%b0%8d%e8%a8%88%e5%8a%832/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">女神配對計劃2</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e8%8b%a5%e6%80%9d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳若思</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3541122\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 12 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T09:24:01.832510+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1334,"images":11,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T07:30:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:29.652606+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T09:17:29.652606+00:00","content_hash":"16aee2a2600f6abebc3090de9c3ea6972c2202cfb2c9d02785b7eb58c055e4a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}